Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Inspect Results", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8ba3285b-a320-4e51-91f4-dcccdf1a98ed"],

Cell["\<\
Every completed check remains in ubResults, including Raw, Prepared, Output, \
Reference, Residual, Pieces, and FinalTrace. Solver errors and timeouts \
remain explicit records. A solver reaching its time limit may still return \
its best checkpoint; inspect FinalTrace for its termination reason.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d9d168f8-ff89-4d54-adce-096515f3d9c9"],

